  "modifications": "2026-09-07: Individually compared 成 and eleven grass-head glyphs against all cumulative stages in Korean official f37.hwp. For 成, moved original stroke 2 before 1, and split stroke 3 at its third median point after normalization, retaining every point. For each reviewed grass-head glyph, split original stroke 1 into left and right horizontals with the recorded gap, interpolated cut endpoints to one decimal, and removed only the connecting bridge; output order is left horizontal, original stroke 2, right horizontal, original stroke 3, then unchanged remaining paths. All other normalized paths and stroke boundaries are retained. Recipes and one-based sourceStrokeIndices describe the correspondence; repeated indices identify split portions. These are implementation centerlines, not official vector coordinates. APL notices preserved; official images not distributed. pathsSha256 is SHA-256 of UTF-8 JSON.stringify(paths).",
